> Oh yeah, I was too lazy.  Will cover up in the next round.

It seems that power_table and thermal_table are non-const in the
definition.  Also opregion_data is also passed as non-const to
intel_pmic_install_opregion_handler().

So only id_table[] can be const, so far.

(It's a good hint for further cleanup patches ;)


